   {
    "rank": 1,
    "text": "[Shadow Unleashed] summons +1 Ghastly Mask, and the fireballs it fires can ricochet."
   },
   {
    "rank": 2,
    "text": "Before [Scorching Rampage] is cast, there is a 50% chance to apply one stack of [Searing Flame Curse] to the nearest target; the higher Sinister Shade's Bravery, the higher the trigger chance."
   },
   {
    "rank": 3,
    "text": "[Searing Flame Curse] max stacks +2. When detonated, if [Searing Flame Curse] has more than 3 stacks, each additional 1 stack increases Stun duration by 0.5 seconds."
   },
   {
    "rank": 4,
    "text": "[Flame Sigil Binding] drains an additional 50 Rage."
   },
   {
    "rank": 5,
    "text": "When [Searing Flame Curse] detonates, the Stun effect it triggers has a 10% chance to be changed into Divine Decree; the more Sinister Shade's Bravery exceeds the target's, the higher the trigger chance. Divine Decree: the character cannot act, and this effect cannot be dispelled."
   },
   {
    "rank": 6,
    "text": "All damage dealt by Sinister Shade +10%"
